/long: 200 len=5 body=[12345] kind=[] fast=1
/204: 204 len=0 body=[] kind=[] fast=1
/interim: 200 len=2 body=[ok] kind=[] fast=1
/garbage: rc=-7 (malformed response: not an HTTP/1.x status line)
/badcl: rc=-7 (malformed response: invalid Content-Length)
/twocl: rc=-7 (malformed response: invalid Content-Length)
/barelf: rc=-7 (malformed response: status line not ended by CRLF)
/badchunk: rc=-7 (malformed response: bad chunked body)
/cutchunk: rc=-7 (connection closed before the end of the response)
/upgrade: rc=-7 (malformed response: unexpected protocol switch (101))
/empty: rc=-6 (the server closed the connection without a response)
/big: rc=-9 (response body larger than 1000 bytes)
/bigclose: rc=-9 (response body larger than 1000 bytes)
/bigchunk: rc=-9 (response body larger than 1000 bytes)
